7. **Workspace-scoped issues**: **/workspaces/*/issues** → ok(mockIssues) for GET, route.fallback() for other methods

8. **Health check**: **/api/health → { status: "ok", daemon: true }

9. **Auth token**: **/api/auth/token → { token: "test-token-e2e" }

10. **Consolidated loom API handler** (**/api/loom/**):
    ```typescript
    await page.route("**/api/loom/**", async (route) => {
      const url = route.request().url();
      if (!options?.loomServerAvailable && options?.loomServerAvailable !== undefined) {
        // Simulate loom unavailable: return invalid JSON
        await route.fulfill({ status: 200, contentType: "application/json", body: "invalid json{" });
        return;
