## navigateAndWait() Implementation

```typescript
async function navigateAndWait(page: Page) {
  await page.goto("/ws/default/", { waitUntil: "domcontentloaded" });
  // Wait for workspace data to load — sidebar renders after this
  await page.waitForResponse(
    (res) => res.url().includes("/api/workspaces/active") && res.status() === 200,
    { timeout: 10000 },
  );
}
```

Note: For tests with workspaceError option, do NOT use navigateAndWait — use page.goto directly since /api/workspaces/active returns 500.

## Edge Cases & Error Handling

1. **Loom server unavailable** (loomServerAvailable: false): Consolidated /api/loom/** handler returns invalid JSON ('invalid json{') for all loom endpoints. useAgents catches the parse error and returns empty defaults (agents: [], connectionState: 'disconnected'). Expected: sidebar renders workspace tree but agent section header ("Agents") is absent because agents.length === 0.
2. **Empty agents, loom connected** (emptyAgents: true): /api/loom/api/agents returns { agents: [] }, /api/loom/api/status returns empty agents and agent_tasks. Agent section header not rendered. SidebarStatusBar returns null (SidebarStatusBar.tsx:45-47) because agents.length === 0.
3. **Agent card status parsing**: parseLoomStatus() handles 'working: bd-101 (5m)' → type "working" (regex match), 'ready' → type "ready" (string match). getStatusLabel() returns "Working" and "Ready" respectively.
4. **Commit count display**: AgentCard shows "+{ahead}" only when ahead > 0, "-{behind}" only when behind > 0 (AgentCard.tsx:157-174). Both conditions checked independently.
5. **SidebarStatusBar counting**: working/planning → "working" count, review → "reviewing" count, everything else → "idle" count (SidebarStatusBar.tsx:27-39).
6. **Work queue data source**: WorkQueueSection receives counts from App.tsx computed from workspace-scoped issues (App.tsx:290), NOT from loom server tasks. Counts derive from issue statuses: deferred→backlog, open→open, blocked→blocked, in_progress→inProgress, review→needsReview, closed→done.
7. **Sidebar collapse**: data-collapsed attribute on aside element (WorkspaceTree.tsx:600), aria-expanded on toggle button (line 605). Collapsed state hides content and shows collapsedBadge.
8. **Collapsed badge**: Shows totalActiveCount (total agents across repos) and data-health color when collapsed. Shows data-disconnected="true" with "!" content when connection state is disconnected (WorkspaceTree.tsx:907-924).
9. **Workspace error**: When /api/workspaces/active returns 500, useWorkspaceRepos sets wsConnectionState to "error_never_connected". WorkspaceTree renders ErrorDisplay with data-testid="error-display" and data-variant="connection-error", title "Workspace unavailable" (WorkspaceTree.tsx:671-684).
10. **Agent merging**: WorkspaceTree merges fleetAgents (from useAgentContext/loom endpoints) with workspaceConfigAgents (from useWorkspaceContext/workspace data). Config agents not in fleet appear as "configured" placeholders (WorkspaceTree.tsx:176-195).

