**Render branch**: The current render logic is a ternary chain: info ? ... : logs ? ... : git ? ... : files. Insert a new 'diff' branch between 'git' and the 'files' fallback. Use scrollableContent container (same as git tab) wrapped in Suspense with the loadingFallback spinner (same as files tab).

**CSS variables**: Add diff-specific color custom properties (--color-diff-add, --color-diff-del, --color-diff-hunk, and their -bg variants) to the global variables.css file, both in :root (dark) and [data-theme='light'] sections. This is more appropriate than DiffTab.module.css since theme variables belong in the global design token file. These variables will be consumed by DiffTab.module.css (created in the dependency task loomcli-by5tn).

