Add the ToolAwareBackend optional interface:
```go
// ToolAwareBackend is an optional interface that backends can implement
// to support tool allow/deny lists from role constraints.
type ToolAwareBackend interface {
    Backend
    SetAllowedTools(tools []string)
    SetDeniedTools(tools []string)
