But this overcomplicates the task scope. hfsf0.9 is responsible for the integration hook. This task (hfsf0.8) is just the dropdown UI component.

**FINAL decision**: MentionDropdown is a pure presentational component. It renders a list, highlights the focused item, and calls onSelect/onClose. The parent handles ALL keyboard logic (ArrowUp/Down to change focusedIndex, Enter to select, Escape to close). This is the simplest approach and keeps MentionDropdown fully decoupled.

