- **AgentStatusEntry**: Type alias from generated OpenAPI type, not hand-written duplicate. Follows LoomCommitDetail/LoomFileChange pattern.
- **fetchWorkspaceAgentStatus**: Workspace-scoped agent API function. First param is always workspaceId: string. Uses typed api.GET with path params. Lives in api/agents/agentStatus.ts.
- **mapToLoomAgentStatus**: Pure function adapter, no side effects. Takes single AgentStatusEntry, returns LoomAgentStatus. Lives alongside the types it bridges in types/agent/agentStatus.ts.
- **Daemon supervision fields on LoomAgentStatus**: All prefixed with context (supervisor_status, restart_count, etc.) and all optional. Grouped under a JSDoc section comment.

