## Summary

Fix the duplicate-worktree-name collision in `BuildAgentQueueFn` so the GET `/api/workspaces/{ws}/agents/{name}/queue` endpoint returns the correct agent's role constraints and filtered queue in a workspace where two agents share the same bare worktree name across different repos. Mirror the `?repo=` query-parameter pattern established by the agentcontrol handlers (loomcli-lg0de.16) in `HandleAgentQueue`, update the in-closure agent lookup in `BuildAgentQueueFn` to match by compound key (`AgentEntry.Key()`) with an unambiguous-bare-name fallback (the `resolveToCompoundKey` pattern), and introduce an `ErrAgentAmbiguous` sentinel so an ambiguous bare-name request is surfaced as 409 rather than silently dispatching to the first match.

