3. SweepOrphans() returns 0 when there are no stale sessions
4. SweepOrphans() is called during Daemon.Start() before any agent goroutines launch
5. SweepOrphans() is called during loom serve startup before serving requests
6. Query() behavior is unchanged — same results, same healing, same filter semantics
7. All existing stale_test.go and finalize_test.go tests pass without modification
8. A stale session healed by SweepOrphans is NOT re-healed by a subsequent Query() call
