**ActiveCount (line 112-116):** Add nil guard before the mutex lock:
```go
func (ct *ConcurrencyTracker) ActiveCount(role string) int {
    if ct == nil {
        return 0
    }
    ct.mu.Lock()
    defer ct.mu.Unlock()
    return ct.counts[role]
}
```

Update the doc comment on line 111 to add "Safe on nil receiver." suffix, matching Acquire/TryAcquire/Release/Close.

**Counts (line 119-128):** Add nil guard before the mutex lock:
```go
func (ct *ConcurrencyTracker) Counts() map[string]int {
    if ct == nil {
        return map[string]int{}
    }
    ct.mu.Lock()
    defer ct.mu.Unlock()

    result := make(map[string]int, len(ct.counts))
    for k, v := range ct.counts {
