- Reads ap.transcriptPath under ap.mu lock (consistent with existing field reads at lines 98-105).
- Checks transcript first, log second. Logs "source" field for debugging.
- Both tiers use the lastStart floor (line 132-134 pattern preserved).
- When transcript path is empty (session creation failed, custom role) or file doesn't exist (no hooks yet), falls to log tier.
- When neither source has data (activitySource == "none"), no kill is attempted — agent is in early startup.

