- `createWebhook(req: CreateWebhookRequest): Promise<WebhookCreateResponse>` — POST /api/webhooks
- `getWebhook(id: string): Promise<WebhookView>` — GET /api/webhooks/{id}
- `updateWebhook(id: string, req: UpdateWebhookRequest): Promise<WebhookView>` — PATCH /api/webhooks/{id}
- `deleteWebhook(id: string): Promise<void>` — DELETE /api/webhooks/{id}
